{
  "server": "jp",
  "storyId": "main_1_level_main_01-08_beg",
  "groupId": "main_1",
  "stageId": "main_01-08",
  "title": "意志",
  "storyCode": "1-8",
  "avgTag": "戦闘前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/jp/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_01-08_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "98a8aacf09d870184b076ca20029d236a19a962f410d881fbead24d8bc5268fb",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第十一关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ニアール",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "アーミヤ、ドクターを連れて離脱してくれ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ニアール",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "急げ、今すぐに！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "そんな……そんなことできません！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ニアール",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "君も感じ取っているだろう！　このままでは、全員ここで命を落とすことになりかねん！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ニアール",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "あのタルラという人物は――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ニアール",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "彼女は、まさしく怪物だ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "それでも、一緒に戦います！　そうすれば、きっと可能性は……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ニアール",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "――ドクターのことはどうする？　安全を確保できるのか？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "……そ、れは……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ニアール",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "E4小隊！　これより、この場にとどまり、奴らを足止めするぞ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ニアール",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "アーミヤとDr.{@nickname}、そして医療班が撤退する時間を稼ぐんだ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "――待った。その役目、俺たちに任せてもらおうか。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ニアール",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "Ace、何を言って――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "任せてくれと言ってるんだ。俺は本気だぞ、ニアール。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ニアール",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "だが……！　周囲のすべてを融かしてしまう相手に、どう対処しようというんだ！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "そうですよ！　あなたたちを残して、撤退なんてできません！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "ロドスは……絶対に、みなさんを見捨てたりはしませんから！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "アーミヤ、もう時間がない！　撤退するんだ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "――頼む、俺たちを信じてくれ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "っ、ですが……！　ロドスの仲間が犠牲になったらと思うと……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "作戦目標を忘れるな！　何のためにここへ来たのか、思い出せ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "もとの目標が何であろうと、これだけは譲りたくないんです！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "タルラ",
      "speakerToken": "char_011_talula_1",
      "operatorId": "char_011_talula",
      "portraitKey": "char_011_talula",
      "text": "――"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ニアール",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "なんだ……？　彼女の手に、何かが集まって……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "前衛オペレーター",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "ま、周りの空間が……歪んでるような……！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ニアール",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "――いや、あれは陽炎だ！　熱された空気のせいで、景色が揺らめいて見えるのだろう……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "！　気をつけてください！　あのアーツは――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "待って……ダメ！　ニアールさん！　戻ってください！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "あれは、ただのアーツなんかじゃ――"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "タルラ",
      "speakerToken": "char_011_talula_1",
      "operatorId": "char_011_talula",
      "portraitKey": "char_011_talula",
      "text": "――少し、静かにしてもらおうか。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ニアール",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "ぐ、あっ……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ニアール",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "……っはあ、はぁ……ッ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "まずいッ――ニアール！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ニアール",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "が、はっ……来るな！　この程度……大したことは、ない……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ニアール",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "……こんな……火傷、くらい……で……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "火傷くらい、だと……？　バカを言うな！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "鎧をそこまで傷つけられておいて、強がるんじゃない！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "これ以上戦うのはよせ、すぐに離脱を――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ニアール",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "――来るなと、言ったはずだ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "っ、この頑固者め……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "タルラ",
      "speakerToken": "char_011_talula_1",
      "operatorId": "char_011_talula",
      "portraitKey": "char_011_talula",
      "text": "――ふむ、面白い。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "伏せろ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ニアール",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "ぐっ、ごほっ……今のは、一体……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "辺り一帯が融け落ちていく……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "まるで、見えない炎が頭上で広がっているような……あんなものを喰らえば、ひとたまりもないぞ……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "こうなれば全員、撤退だ！　無駄な犠牲を出すわけにはいかん！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ニアール",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ニアール",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "我々は……何を、相手に……しているんだ……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "とにかく、あのアーツを止めないことには打開できんな……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "――狙撃オペレーター！　奴に照準を！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "タルラ",
      "speakerToken": "char_011_talula_1",
      "operatorId": "char_011_talula",
      "portraitKey": "char_011_talula",
      "text": "――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "タルラ",
      "speakerToken": "char_011_talula_1",
      "operatorId": "char_011_talula",
      "portraitKey": "char_011_talula",
      "text": "――確かに……抵抗とは、大地に希望を芽吹かせるものだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "タルラ",
      "speakerToken": "char_011_talula_1",
      "operatorId": "char_011_talula",
      "portraitKey": "char_011_talula",
      "text": "しかし、その抵抗が貴様らの運命を変えることはない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "撃てッ！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "タルラ",
      "speakerToken": "char_011_talula_1",
      "operatorId": "char_011_talula",
      "portraitKey": "char_011_talula",
      "text": "――チェルノボーグは解放された。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "タルラ",
      "speakerToken": "char_011_talula_1",
      "operatorId": "char_011_talula",
      "portraitKey": "char_011_talula",
      "text": "それを以て、我らはすでに目的を果たしていたが……貴様らに、少し興味が湧いてな。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "何……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "タルラ",
      "speakerToken": "char_011_talula_1",
      "operatorId": "char_011_talula",
      "portraitKey": "char_011_talula",
      "text": "まあ、あくまで興味をそそられただけ、なのだが。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "タルラ",
      "speakerToken": "char_011_talula_1",
      "operatorId": "char_011_talula",
      "portraitKey": "char_011_talula",
      "text": "何しろ、貴様らは選択を誤ったのだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "タルラ",
      "speakerToken": "char_011_talula_1",
      "operatorId": "char_011_talula",
      "portraitKey": "char_011_talula",
      "text": "ロドスよ。――真の意味で、感染者側に立つべきだったな。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医療オペレーター",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "何が……起きたんでしょうか？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医療オペレーター",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "どうして、広場中が焼けて……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医療オペレーター",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "今のは、一体――けほっ、ごほっ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医療オペレーター",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "い、息をするだけで……喉が、焼けて……しまいそう……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "前衛オペレーター",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "な……何もかも、燃え尽きちまった……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "前衛オペレーター",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "奴のそばには、弓矢どころか、石ころすらも残ってない……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "前衛オペレーター",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "この一瞬で……周りのすべてを、焼き尽くしたのか……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "タルラ",
      "speakerToken": "char_011_talula_1",
      "operatorId": "char_011_talula",
      "portraitKey": "char_011_talula",
      "text": "――貴様らが、解放者にふさわしい粘り強さを持っていることは認めよう。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "前衛オペレーター",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "……こんなふうに、塵も残さず燃やしてしまえるなんて……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ニアール",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "……アーミヤ。これでわかったはずだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ニアール",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "――誰かが残って、奴を止めなければならない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "タルラ",
      "speakerToken": "char_011_talula_1",
      "operatorId": "char_011_talula",
      "portraitKey": "char_011_talula",
      "text": "――だが、それにはもう飽いた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "……っ……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ニアール",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "アーミヤ！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "タルラ",
      "speakerToken": "char_011_talula_1",
      "operatorId": "char_011_talula",
      "portraitKey": "char_011_talula",
      "text": "貴様らは同胞を殺めたのだ。報いを受けさせねばなるまい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "タルラ",
      "speakerToken": "char_011_talula_1",
      "operatorId": "char_011_talula",
      "portraitKey": "char_011_talula",
      "text": "さあ、私好みの結末へと導いてやろう。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "タルラ",
      "speakerToken": "char_011_talula_1",
      "operatorId": "char_011_talula",
      "portraitKey": "char_011_talula",
      "text": "――滅びよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "ッ、まずい……！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "退避しろ！　行け、早く行けッ！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "あんな攻撃を喰らったら終わりだ……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "急げ、アーミヤとドクターを守れ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ニアール",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "いや、これでは間に合わん――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ニアール",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "私が奴を足止めする！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医療オペレーター",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "きゃああっ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医療オペレーター",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医療オペレーター",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "……あ、れ……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医療オペレーター",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "あ……アーミヤさん！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "――誰一人、傷つけさせはしません。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "タルラ",
      "speakerToken": "char_011_talula_1",
      "operatorId": "char_011_talula",
      "portraitKey": "char_011_talula",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#9",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "絶対に……止めてみせます！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "タルラ",
      "speakerToken": "char_011_talula_1",
      "operatorId": "char_011_talula",
      "portraitKey": "char_011_talula",
      "text": "――ほう？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#9",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "ぐ、っ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#9",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "私が……守ら、ないと……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "たった一人で……あのアーツを、押しとどめているのか……！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ニアール",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "だが、あれほどの規模だ……受け止めきるのは無理があるぞ……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ニアール",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "たとえアーミヤでも……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ニアール",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "彼女のアーツを以てしても、長くはもたん！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医療オペレーター",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "そんな……アーミヤさん！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "……問題、ありません……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "私は……大丈夫、ですっ……！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "みなさんを……守らないと、いけませんから……！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医療オペレーター",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "……黒い障壁が……アーツを、阻んでくれてる……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#9",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "く……う、ああっ……！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "前衛オペレーター",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "ま、まずい……！　障壁が燃えていくぞ……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "アーミヤ、もうよせ！！　このままでは、お前の指輪が――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "――ごめんなさい、ドクター……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "たとえ……そうなったとしても……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "それが厄災を招くことになったとしても……そして、私自身がどうなろうとも……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "私は、二度と……目の前で、大切な人を……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "タルラ",
      "speakerToken": "char_011_talula_1",
      "operatorId": "char_011_talula",
      "portraitKey": "char_011_talula",
      "text": "――ふっ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "タルラ",
      "speakerToken": "char_011_talula_1",
      "operatorId": "char_011_talula",
      "portraitKey": "char_011_talula",
      "text": "良い覚悟だ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "っあ……ああああっ……！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ニアール",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "アーミヤ！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ニアール",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "くっ……これ以上、黙って見てはいられん！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "何をするつもりだ？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ニアール",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "あの厄介な龍のアーツを止める！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "お前、まさか……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ニアール",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "――「カジミエーシュの光芒よ、この耀騎士が身を捧げよう」！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "っ、ドクター！　早く行け！　我々がアーミヤをサポートする！　だからお前は……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "タルラ",
      "speakerToken": "char_011_talula_1",
      "operatorId": "char_011_talula",
      "portraitKey": "char_011_talula",
      "text": "――はァッ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#9",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "う、ああああっ！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#9",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "……っ、え……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#9",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "もう大丈夫だ、アーミヤ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#9",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "――Ace、さん……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "お前は十分頑張った。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "だから、一人で重荷を背負うな。俺たちにも少しは分けてくれ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "私は――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "アーミヤ……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "――ドーベルマン、皆を連れて先に行け！　それと、ニアール！　この場は俺たちに任せてもらおう！　……なに、すぐ追いつくさ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "……Ace、お前……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "そん、な……Aceさん……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "っ、絶対に……帰ってきて、ください……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "お前さんは、きっと俺のことを覚えちゃいないんだろうが……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "俺のほうは、お前のことを覚えてる。昔どんな奴だったのかってこともな。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "……いつの日か、お前には……アーミヤと一緒に、この残酷な大地と向き合うべき時がくるだろう。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "だからどうか、あの子を守ってやってくれ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "――さあ、行くんだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "幸運を祈る！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
